<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Supplementary Materials for MST-Distill</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section presents supplementary materials that validate key design choices, clarify implementation details, and provide additional evidence for the effectiveness of the proposed <span id="A3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">MST-Distill</span> framework.</p>
</div>
<section id="A3.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.1. </span>MST-Distill: Pseudocode</h3>

<div id="A3.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The overall procedure of MST-Distill, encompassing the three stages described in main text, is summarized in Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ C.1. MST-Distill: Pseudocode ‣ Appendix C Supplementary Materials for MST-Distill ‣ MST-Distill: Mixture of Specialized Teachers for Cross-Modal Knowledge Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> MST-Distill Framework for Cross-Modal Knowledge Distillation</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l0" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l0.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
              
              
             Multimodal dataset <math id="alg1.l0.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}=\{(x_{1}^{(s)},\dots,x_{M}^{(s)};y^{(s)})\}_{s=1}^{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>S</mi></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}=\{(x_{1}^{(s)},\dots,x_{M}^{(s)};y^{(s)})\}_{s=1}^{S}</annotation></semantics></math>;Target student modality index <math id="alg1.l0.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\in\{1,2,...,M\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\in\{1,2,...,M\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l0a" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l0a.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">0:</span></span>
              
              
             Trained student model <math id="alg1.l0a.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{m_{t}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>f</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{m_{t}}</annotation></semantics></math> with optimal parameters <math id="alg1.l0a.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta_{m_{t}}^{*}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>θ</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta_{m_{t}}^{*}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">1:</span></span>
              
              
             <span id="alg1.l1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Stage 1: Collaborative Initialization (CI)</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">2:</span></span>
              
              
             Initialize <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\theta_{{m_{i}}}\}_{i=0}^{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\theta_{{m_{i}}}\}_{i=0}^{M}</annotation></semantics></math> for all modality-specific models <math id="alg1.l2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{f_{{m_{i}}}\}_{i=0}^{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{f_{{m_{i}}}\}_{i=0}^{M}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">3:</span></span>
              
              
             <math id="alg1.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\theta_{{m_{i}}}^{*}\}_{i=0}^{M}\leftarrow\arg\min_{\{\theta_{{m_{i}}}\}_{i=0}^{M}}\;\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{S_{1}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>θ</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mi>min</mi><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\theta_{{m_{i}}}^{*}\}_{i=0}^{M}\leftarrow\arg\min_{\{\theta_{{m_{i}}}\}_{i=0}^{M}}\;\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{S_{1}}}</annotation></semantics></math> {Equation (<a href="#S3.E4" title="In 3.1. Collaborative Initialization of Modality-Specific Members ‣ 3. Method ‣ MST-Distill: Mixture of Specialized Teachers for Cross-Modal Knowledge Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>)}

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l4.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">4:</span></span>
              
              
             <span id="alg1.l4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Stage 2: Specialized Teacher Adaptation (STA)</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l5.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">5:</span></span>
              
              
             Load <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\theta_{{m_{i}}}^{*}\}_{i=0}^{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>θ</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\theta_{{m_{i}}}^{*}\}_{i=0}^{M}</annotation></semantics></math> for all models and initialize <math id="alg1.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\theta_{\mathrm{MN}}^{j}\}_{j=1}^{N}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>θ</mi><mi>MN</mi><mi>j</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\theta_{\mathrm{MN}}^{j}\}_{j=1}^{N}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l6.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">6:</span></span>
              
              
             Identify target student modality <math id="alg1.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m_{t}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m_{t}</annotation></semantics></math> and corresponding student model <math id="alg1.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="f_{m_{t}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>f</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{m_{t}}</annotation></semantics></math>

