              Select top-<math id="alg1.l20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> teachers based on GateNet confidence scores

</div>
<div id="alg1.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l21.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">21:</span></span>
              
              
              <math id="alg1.l21.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\{\theta_{m_{t}}^{*},\theta_{\mathrm{GN}}^{*}\}\leftarrow\arg\min_{\theta_{m_{t}},\theta_{\mathrm{GN}}}\;\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{S_{3}}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>θ</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>θ</mi><mi>GN</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mi>min</mi><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>GN</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\theta_{m_{t}}^{*},\theta_{\mathrm{GN}}^{*}\}\leftarrow\arg\min_{\theta_{m_{t}},\theta_{\mathrm{GN}}}\;\mathcal{L}_{\mathrm{S_{3}}}</annotation></semantics></math> {Equation (<a href="#S3.E18" title="In 3.3. Dynamic Knowledge Distillation with a Mixture of Specialized Teachers ‣ 3. Method ‣ MST-Distill: Mixture of Specialized Teachers for Cross-Modal Knowledge Distillation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">18</span></a>)}

</div>
